ted primes up to 62-bit and built-in primes `BabyBear` / `KoalaBear`.\nL109: \nL110:   * Staged Transforms: The `SubSize<M>` operator enables memory-efficient transforms at large `N` by decomposing them into two kernel passes.\nL111: \nL112:   * Reusable Twiddle Tables: Twiddle factors are computed once and reused across an entire batch, minimizing startup overhead.\nL113: \nL114: On this page\nL115: 【48†Privacy Policy†www.nvidia.com】 | 【49†Your Privacy Choices†www.nvidia.com】 | 【50†Terms of Service†www.nvidia.com】 | 【51†Accessibility†www.nvidia.com】 | 【52†Corporate Policies†www.nvidia.com】 | 【53†Product Security†www.nvidia.com】 | 【54†Contact†www.nvidia.com】\nL116: \nL117: Copyright © 2024-2026, NVIDIA Corporation & Affiliates. All rights reserved.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\ncuPQC-NTT: Number Theoretic Transform — cuPQC (https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cupqc/libraries/cupqc_ntt/cupqc_ntt_feature.html)\nciteturn2view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cupqc/libraries/cupqc_ntt/cupqc_ntt_feature.html\",\"pattern\":\"Stage\"}); Total lines: 118\nL69:   * Staged NTT: For large `N`, per-block shared memory cannot hold the full workspace for an `N`-point transform in a single pass, so a staged NTT is required. With `SubSize<M>` and two kernel passes: the first stage runs `M` parallel `K`-point contiguous NTTs (`K = N/M`); the second runs `K` parallel `M`-point strided NTTs. Each stage limits the per-block working set to `max(K, M)` elements, enabling transforms that would not fit in a single block’s shared memory.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGitHub - uulong950/qingming-g64-ntt-cuda: Qingming CUDA artifact for native Goldilocks/G64 STARK-LDE NTT with explicit layout, timing, and correctness contracts. · GitHub (https://github.com/uulong950/qingming-g64-ntt-cuda)\nciteturn2view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"https://github.com/uulong950/qingming-g64-ntt-cuda\",\"pattern\":\"license\"}); Total lines: 537\nNo matching text found for \"license\""
